OL,3,GNEWSAWoman struggles to leave home
OL,4,Aafter multiple attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "brave" victim of multiple sexual
OL,7,Fassaults has spoken out about the
OL,8,Flasting impact of the attacks as a
OL,9,F70-year-old predator is jailed.
OL,11,FNeil Turner, of Fair Furlong,
OL,12,FBishopsworth in Bristol, was found
OL,13,Fguilty of two counts of sexual assault
OL,14,Fby penetration and two counts of sexual
OL,15,Fassault by touching following a trial
OL,16,Fin May.
OL,18,FHe was sentenced at Bristol Crown Court
OL,19,Fon Friday to nine-and-a-half years in
OL,20,Fprison.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
