OL,3,GNEWSAWoman struggles to leave home
OL,4,Aafter multiple attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement read out in court, the
OL,7,Fvictim said: "What Neil has done has
OL,8,Fcompletely devastated me. As soon as I
OL,9,Fleave the house, I experience panic
OL,10,Fattacks which make we want to return
OL,11,Fhome and lock all the doors."
